d":"7ead2eef-4b51-4302-827e-52e1a9fba4b4","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"34ee-efb0-1607-4906"},{"link_uuid":"2c1b695f-d4cd-4d89-9a1f-d29442990303","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"6bb3-9a14-46a1-46dc"},{"link_uuid":"078f55b9-fe68-4e06-8579-344dceef5c1c","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"92a4-171c-3d30-43af"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\nThe src/rebar/_store cohort contains audited comments or docstrings that obscure current behavior with repetition, obvious narration, duplicated explanation, or historical detail. The audit is pinned to `9e65567b79ffe872534c3c656ade7b34340d8192`.\n\n## Approach\nEdit explanatory text only in this directory/subsystem cohort. Condense it to current, non-obvious rationale and constraints; retain every file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `src/rebar/_store/push_state.py:1-39, 54-170` — Preserve durable local marker, non-failure reasons, backlog count/growth, and never-raise behavior. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_store/push.py:1-13, 77-85, 185-317, 336-409, 563-592` — Preserve push modes, late-bound recovery seams, detached-child security, retry classification, lock-file exclusion, and final push trigger. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_store/s3_doctor.py:1-14, 48-59, 177-345` — Preserve lossless multi-head fold, clean-worktree guard, published-ref anchoring, and write-new-before-delete ordering. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_store/staging.py:1-32, 125-137, 243-263` — Preserve invisible staging, ownership proof, stale cleanup boundary, and atomic publication. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_store/stamped_lock.py:1-14, 36-78, 112-118` — Preserve shared stamp/staleness use, one retry, bounded redundant-work race, and duplicate-implementation guard. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_store/store_usability.py:1-86, 125-192` — Preserve usable-store predicate, `.git` parent-walk guard, snapshot readability, and write-only Git requirement. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_store/sync.py:1-41, 67-128, 155-343` — Preserve fetch-outside/write-inside lock, union-not-reset safety, unrelated-history split, explicit refspec, and recoverable merge classes. Consumer: none found.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make test`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_store/push_state.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/_store/push.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/_store/s3_doctor.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/_store/staging.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/_store/stamped_lock.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/_store/store_usability.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"sr